                                    </div>

                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Should a D2C jewelry brand hire a specialist jewelry SEO agency or a generic e-com SEO agency?</h3>
                                        <p>Specialist by year 2. Specialist costs 2-3x but delivers 4-8x organic revenue over 24-36 months. Generic e-com SEO with category-agnostic templates fails jewelry's 6-dimension keyword architecture + certification content + specialised schema needs.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the difference in content approach between specialist + generic jewelry SEO?</h3>
                                        <p>Specialist: 6-dimension silo pages + long-tail commercial-intent + certification content + comparison depth + AI Overviews optimisation + regional-language where justifies + real category fluency. Generic: category-only silos + head-term targeting + "10 trends" listicles + English-only + vanity ranking metrics.</p>
                                        <h3>How many silo pages does a jewelry SEO programme need?</h3>
                                        <p>40-80 silo pages across piece x metal x gemstone x occasion x budget x style dimensions. Built over 12-18 months. Each with unique content + internal linking + breadcrumbs + canonical hygiene + schema. This is the compounding SEO engine foundation.</p>
                                        <h3>What schema should be deployed for jewelry SEO?</h3>
                                        <p>Product + Organization + LocalBusiness (per showroom if applicable) + BreadcrumbList + FAQPage + Article (blogs) + Review + AggregateRating. All in JSON-LD sitewide. Typical impression uplift 15-30% within 45 days + unlocks AI Overviews + Google Shopping rich results eligibility.</p>
                                        <h3>How do we optimise jewelry content for AI Overviews + ChatGPT + Gemini citation?</h3>
                                        <p>Answer-first paragraphs (40-80 word direct answers), structured lists + tables in comparison content, semantic headings matching query phrasing, entity clarity (named brands + certifications + prices), verifiable specifics, and an llms.txt file at root. 25-60% additional traffic layer possible within 6-12 months.</p>
                                        <h3>What is a realistic jewelry SEO retainer?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 1-3 lakh / month for specialist. Rs 40K-1.5 lakh for generic e-com. Specialist justified for brands targeting Rs 50L+ / month revenue where organic SEO compounds into 25-45% of revenue by month 24.</p>
                                        <h3>Can we hire in-house SEO team instead of a specialist agency?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes at Rs 25 Cr+ / month revenue when in-house team is 4-6 specialists (writer + editor + technical + link builder + strategist + designer). Below this scale, specialist agency delivers better cost + expertise. Hybrid (in-house senior + specialist agency execution) works from Rs 5-25 Cr revenue.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD GrowthLabs approach jewelry SEO for clients?</h3>
                                        <p>6-dimension silo architecture, 40-80 pages over 12-18 months, 65-120 content library over 18-24 months, full schema deployment, AI Overviews optimisation, regional-language SEO where justifies, organic-revenue-attributed reporting. See our <a href="/resources/jewelry_seo_strategy_long_tail_specific_piece.php">jewelry SEO strategy playbook</a>.</p>
